window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The mysterious dance with destiny... in a parallel reality.</b></p> <p>After a devastating storm kills her family, Harper Close is suddenly whisked away to an alternate reality in which they're still alive—but don't remember her. With the rare chance to change fate, can Harper prevent a tragedy?</p> <p>With time slipping away, Harper faces a daunting task: to convince her family and the skeptical townsfolk of the need to prepare for the impending disaster, even while evading a menacing figure from the town's mysterious past, who is determined to kill her.</p> <p>Time Parallel <i>charts Harper's parallel journeys through love, loss, mystery, and redemption as she grapples with the challenges of two divergent realities.</i></p>"; 
